    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Main Goal:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal in <strong>Bar of Betrayal</strong> is simple: Regulars must complete all their tasks to win, while Rogues try to secretly take them out. If the Regulars finish every task or vote out all the Rogues, they win. But if the Rogues eliminate enough Regulars first, they win instead. Work fast, watch your back, and don\u2019t trust anyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Roles:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular</strong> \u2013 Here to enjoy the night. Play darts, drink beer, play arcade games and more, but stay sharp. Punks are out there, and if you\u2019re not careful, your fun night could end badly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/a82b7596f56ee48b7fda56875f0b2259.poster.avif?t=1745475724\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/a82b7596f56ee48b7fda56875f0b2259.webm?t=1745475724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/a82b7596f56ee48b7fda56875f0b2259.mp4?t=1745475724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punk</strong> \u2013 A master of deception and sabotage. Fake tasks, blend in, and eliminate others without drawing suspicion. Create chaos to secure your victory. Stay unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/de8538ecaa94a504cbe0860389f39564.poster.avif?t=1745475724\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/de8538ecaa94a504cbe0860389f39564.webm?t=1745475724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/de8538ecaa94a504cbe0860389f39564.mp4?t=1745475724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gameplay:</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective-Based Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regulars</strong> Complete tasks, and spot suspicious behavior.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punks</strong>\u00a0Must sabotage and eliminate players without being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Deduction and Strategy:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust no one</strong>. Observe player actions, bluff your way to victory, and use teamwork to outsmart the opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can call <strong>meetings with the bar manager</strong> to discuss suspicions, accuse others, or strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Communication &amp; Info</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended 5-12 players</strong> for the best experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat</strong> for real-time discussions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom settings</strong>\u00a0for your personal preference.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Main Goal:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal in <strong>Bar of Betrayal</strong> is simple: Regulars must complete all their tasks to win, while Rogues try to secretly take them out. If the Regulars finish every task or vote out all the Rogues, they win. But if the Rogues eliminate enough Regulars first, they win instead. Work fast, watch your back, and don\u2019t trust anyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Roles:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular</strong> \u2013 Here to enjoy the night. Play darts, drink beer, play arcade games and more, but stay sharp. Punks are out there, and if you\u2019re not careful, your fun night could end badly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/a82b7596f56ee48b7fda56875f0b2259.poster.avif?t=1745475724\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/a82b7596f56ee48b7fda56875f0b2259.webm?t=1745475724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/a82b7596f56ee48b7fda56875f0b2259.mp4?t=1745475724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punk</strong> \u2013 A master of deception and sabotage. Fake tasks, blend in, and eliminate others without drawing suspicion. Create chaos to secure your victory. Stay unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590570/extras/de8538ecaa94a504cbe0860389f39564.poster.avif?t=1745475724\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com